WEBVTT

00:03:59.389 --> 00:04:01.150
Usput, Dalai Lama

00:04:01.150 --> 00:04:03.270
je netko tko je prelijepo ostario,

00:04:03.270 --> 00:04:05.677
ali tko želi biti vegetarijanac
i u celibatu?

00:04:05.677 --> 00:04:09.261
(Smijeh)

00:04:12.676 --> 00:04:15.206
Meditacija pomaže.

00:04:15.206 --> 00:04:19.173
(Video) Dijete: Ommm. Ommm. Ommm.

00:04:19.173 --> 00:04:21.110
Isabel Allende: Ommm. Ommm. To je to.

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:23.165
I dobro je početi rano.

00:04:23.165 --> 00:04:26.836
Znate, za sujetnu ženu poput mene,

00:04:26.836 --> 00:04:30.233
jako je teško stariti u ovoj kulturi.